  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 oPt Emergency Appeal - West Bank - Coordination and Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As the operational environment in the West Bank worsens, UNRWA will manage service delivery risks by securing alternative cold-chain and warehousing facilities, assessing risks with support from its Enterprise Risk Management Unit, and ensuring continuity through additional personnel when access is restricted. The Agency will enhance security at installations in high-risk areas by hiring more security staff and will maintain active coordination with UN agencies, NGOs and cluster partners including WFP, UNICEF and the Red Cross. It will also sustain reporting capacity to ensure accountability and support informed, timely decision-making.</narrative>
  </description>
